                  "value" : "<span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span>Any guarantee which has been obtained by means of misrepresentation made by the creditor, or with his knowledge and assent, concerning a material part of the transaction, is invalid. <br/><hr style=\"border: none; margin-bottom: 8px; margin-top: 0;\"/>",
