                "dc.identifier.section_page_note" : [ {
                  "value" : "<span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span>The bailment of goods as security for payment of a debt or performance of a promise is called \"pledge\". The bailor is in this case called the \"pawnor\". The bailee is called the \"pawnee\".<br/><hr style=\"border: none; margin-bottom: 8px; margin-top: 0;\"/>",
